  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "郁田さんは最近どんどんメディアの露出も増えていますが\r\n正直、今のお気持ちはどうですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "bgm": "0205"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010120,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "今の、気持ち……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010130,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "そうですね、まだ実感はなくて\r\nびっくりしてます",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010140,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "でも、毎日とっても楽しいです……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "『楽しい』ですか──\r\n学校やレッスン、お仕事でとっても多忙と思いますけど──",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010150,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "はい\r\nそれは確かに……なんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010160,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "それ以上に、目の前に\r\n次々と新しいことが起こって──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010170,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "きっと、この先もって思ったら\r\n『楽しい』んです",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "──なるほど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "では、ちょっといじわるな質問かもしれませんが\r\nこの先難しい……苦しい状況に陥ったら……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010180,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "────そういうことも\r\nあるかもしれないですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010190,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "それが最後に『楽しい』になるか\r\n『苦しい』になるかどうかは自分次第だと思うので──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010200,
    "speaker": "はるき",
    "text": "そういう状況もちゃんと\r\n経験していきたいなって思います……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "haruki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010200"
  },
