  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "地元の家族や友達と離れて、\r\nアイドルとして活動している鈴木さんですが──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "不安になることとかは、ありませんか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010210,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "……うーん",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010220,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "不安とかは、\r\nあんまり考えたことないですねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010230,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "事務所に仲のいい子もいるし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "仲のいい子──\r\n郁田はるきさんですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010240,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "あはっ、そうです──！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "インタビュアー",
    "text": "それでは、次の質問です\r\nこれから、アイドルとしてやってみたい仕事は？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010250,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "そうですね──",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010260,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "今はふたりとも\r\nソロで活動してるんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400106901/4001069010260"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001069010270,
    "speaker": "羽那",
    "text": "もっと、はるきちゃんと一緒に活動できたら\r\n楽しいかなーって思います──！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
